---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Sprig from '../components/Sprig.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact"
  description="Radiant Gardens is in planning — launching 2026. Real contact details will be announced here as soon as they exist; nothing on this page is live yet."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="status-pill">In planning — launching 2026</p>
      <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
      <h1>Say hello</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Radiant Gardens is in planning — say hello at
        <span class="ph-slot">[to be announced]</span>.
      </p>

      <div class="placeholder-note">
        <p>
          <strong>Contact details are not live yet.</strong> We're still setting
          up the business, so there is no phone number, email address, or
          booking system to publish yet — and we won't invent one.
        </p>
        <p>When launch details are confirmed, they will appear right here:</p>
        <ul class="checklist">
          <li>Email: <span class="ph-slot">[to be announced]</span></li>
          <li>Phone: <span class="ph-slot">[to be announced]</span></li>
          <li>Consultation booking: <span class="ph-slot">[to be announced]</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-muted">
          A promise: this page will always show our real, current contact
          information. If you see a phone number or email address for Radiant
          Gardens anywhere else, it isn't ours.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>Until then</h2>
      <p>
        When consultations open in 2026, a first conversation is simple and
        friendly. If you'd like to be ready, here's what's helpful to have in
        mind:
      </p>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>Where you're located in the Finger Lakes region</li>
        <li>
          A rough idea of the space you're imagining — a sunny corner, a side
          yard, or a whole back yard
        </li>
        <li>What your family loves to eat (and what you'd never grow)</li>
        <li>Any questions about how a built garden fits your home</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        In the meantime, look around: <a href="/services/">the services</a> and
        <a href="/process/">the process</a> explain exactly what working
        together will look like — and <a href="/about/">the founder's story</a>
        explains why we build the way we do.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section cta-band">
    <div class="container">
      <Sprig />
      <h2>Watch this space</h2>
      <p>
        This site — including this page — is the single source of truth for our
        launch details. When booking opens in 2026, you'll find it here first.
      </p>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/">Back to the homepage</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
